  "notes": "Official pages confirm 6 years of enseñansa basico (ages 6–11), a 5-year HAVO and 6-year VWO split into Ciclo basico and Ciclo avansa, and names like Vwo 3/Vwo 4. Unconfirmed: the class names in enseñansa basico (Klas 1–6) and that ciclo basico is 2 years. Secondary is shown along the HAVO route; MAVO and EPB last 4 years."
